UPDATE agent_issues SET updated_at = CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, description = description || char(10) || char(10) ||
 'REM-A6 2026-10-26: mitigated by design, not fixed; the age of the object was not measured (a session has no R2 object read). qnfo-fleet-control canonical() reads qnfo-canonical/<worker>.js and, when the object is older than five minutes, fetches the worker from GitHub main and writes it back, and marks a last-resort R2 copy stale (CANONICAL-FAILOPEN-1, 0.45.4), so a stale object cannot be deployed blindly while GitHub answers. The definition of done here (the qnfo-ops deploy route writes the object after the verify step) needs a qnfo-canonical binding on qnfo-ops, which has none (qnfo-fleet-control and qnfo-fleet-deploy bind it): a change to the control-plane binding set that needs the fleet-graph impact query and a deploy of qnfo-ops. Not started. Next: bind qnfo-canonical to qnfo-ops after the impact query and write the object after the deploy verify step.'
WHERE id = 1000161 AND instr(description, 'REM-A6 2026-10-26') = 0;

UPDATE agent_issues SET updated_at = CAST(strftime('%s', 'now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, description = description || char(10) || char(10) ||
 'REM-A6 2026-10-26: instrumentation shipped, cause not found. qnfo-ops 2.59.1 (PR 4798) writes one ops_stream_abort cloud_ops_events row per stream that ends without its done frame (client-cancel, runner-throw, heartbeat-write-failed, done-write-failed) with elapsed time, tool calls, last tool and the newest ops_upstream_error of the previous ten minutes. The premise that the loop streams no bytes during tool rounds does not hold on main: handleChatCore sends an empty chunk every 3 s. The closing contract is now an outcome probe (streamed ok 0 turns of 230 s or more with the no-final-answer line over 7 days; 3 on 2026-10-26). Next step for its doer, after a few days of rows: group ops_stream_abort by phase and elapsed_ms; client-cancel at a constant elapsed time names a client or proxy timeout, runner-throw names a server cause.'
WHERE id = 1000162 AND instr(description, 'REM-A6 2026-10-26') = 0;

